Z||000003||fieroshop||05-04-2000||12:12 AM||||Speaking of shows and ralies. The Golden Gate Fieros in the San Francisco Bay Area are getting ready for their annual poker run in June. This event was a huge success last year and promises to be even bigger this year. We are looking at having around 50 plus Fieros. We also have a car show with door prizes and raffles and ofcourse the prices for the best poker hands. Also we have trophies that are made from the dogbones of the V6 Fiero. This proofed to be the best trophy that anyone has received and those that did recieve one last year are hoping to get one this year. All I can say is good luck to those that participate. Ther will be fierce competition this year.<BR>Also there is the western regionals ain San Diego in July.||||reg||1
